        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5050FRK, Transitional Brass Freestone Knobset with Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Transitional style of the Freestone Knob with Square Rose makes it an excellent choice for home renovations. It brings style and design together into one elegant yet modern knobset. The Transitional Brass Freestone Knobset with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMK-FRK-specifications.gif?v=1704354595\" width=\"378\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Freestone Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Transitional Freestone Knob with Urban Modern Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Freestone Knob and Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMK-FRK-specifications.pdf?v=1704262370\"><b>Emtek Freestone Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Freestone Knob with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Transitional style of the Freestone Knob with Square Rose makes it an excellent choice for home renovations. It brings style and design together into one elegant yet modern knobset. The Transitional Brass Freestone Knobset with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
